flowchart TD
    ListStart([生命周期入口]) --> ListRecovery[执行公共 journal 检查/修复；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    ListRecovery -->|成功；锁保持| ListCommand[进入当前命令]

    ListCommand --> ListValidate[校验 agent、可选 type 与 installed flag]
    ListValidate -->|失败| ListFail[打印参数或 Agent 错误] --> ListExitError
    ListValidate -->|成功| ListInstalled{指定 --installed?}
    ListInstalled -->|否| ListCloudList[调用云端接口列出资源；仅显式 type 才过滤]
    ListCloudList -->|失败| ListFail
    ListCloudList -->|成功| ListPrintCloud[打印云端 Power] --> ListExitOK([释放锁并正常退出])
    ListInstalled -->|是| ListLocalType[从本地清单按可选 type 定位；仅本地同名跨类型歧义时要求显式 type]
    ListLocalType --> ListAll{agent 等于 all?}
    ListAll -->|否| ListReadOne[读取目标 Agent 安装清单]
    ListReadOne -->|文件不存在| ListEmptyOne[打印空列表] --> ListExitOK
    ListReadOne -->|读取或解析失败| ListFail
    ListReadOne -->|成功| ListPrintOne[打印已安装 Power] --> ListExitOK
    ListAll -->|是| ListNextAgent{还有 Agent?}
    ListNextAgent -->|是| ListReadAgent[读取该 Agent 安装清单]
    ListReadAgent -->|文件不存在| ListRecordEmpty[记录该 Agent 空列表] --> ListNextAgent
    ListReadAgent -->|读取或解析失败| ListRecordFailure[记录该 Agent 失败] --> ListNextAgent
    ListReadAgent -->|成功| ListRecordList[记录该 Agent 已安装列表] --> ListNextAgent
    ListNextAgent -->|否| ListAnyFailure{存在读取失败?}
    ListAnyFailure -->|否| ListPrintAll[按 Agent 分组打印结果] --> ListExitOK
    ListAnyFailure -->|是| ListPrintPartial[打印分组结果与失败汇总] --> ListExitError
    ListCloudList -.进程中断.-> ListInterrupted
    ListValidate -.进程中断.-> ListInterrupted
    ListReadOne -.进程中断.-> ListInterrupted
    ListReadAgent -.进程中断.-> ListInterrupted
